    "Q5_dependencies": "Acceptance of mathematical realism, validity of incompleteness theorems, fine-tuning data",
    "Q6_consequences": "Faith is not irrational but mathematically required; relationship replaces mechanism as ultimate reality",
    "Q7_kill": "If mathematical realism is false, or if a closed system could be self-sustaining, the argument collapses"
  },
